#: ignore.ts:50
msgid "Only the keys you changed in Keyboard Shortcuts will work; default keys such as Space and the arrow keys stop working. Quit (⌘Q) and Toggle Fullscreen (Esc) are not affected. You can turn this off at any time with the switch on the Keyboard Shortcuts page or in the command palette."
msgstr "忽略后，只有你在快捷键设置中修改过的按键生效，Space、方向键等默认按键都将失效。「退出」（⌘Q）与「全屏」（Esc）不受影响，可随时用「快捷键」页上的开关或在命令面板中关闭。"

